  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tCharities\n\t\tFAQs\n\n### Why can&#39;t I see my users in Charities? - User Access\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Wed, 17 Sep, 2025 at 10:44 AM\n\nCharity - Users\n\nNavigation: Capium Home > 'C' icon > Charity > Manage \n\nUsers will show up in Manage > Users after they have entered the Charity module. To do so, they simply need to click the ‘C’ icon at the top and access the Charity module at least once. Following that, they will be automatically included in the Users list.\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
  "bodyHtml": "\n\t<div class=\"breadcrumb\">\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions\"> Solution home </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/9000118165\">Charities</a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/folders/9000198578\">FAQs</a>\n\t</div>\n\t<b class=\"page-stamp page-stamp-article\">\n\t\t<b class=\"icon-page-article\"></b>\n\t</b>\n\n\t<h2 class=\"heading\">Why can&#39;t I see my users in Charities? - User Access\n\t \t<a href=\"#\"\n            class=\"solution-print--icon print--remove\"\n \t\t\ttitle=\"Print this Article\"\n \t\t\tarial-role=\"link\"\n \t\t\tarial-label=\"Print this Article\"\n\t\t\tid=\"print-article\"\n \t\t>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"icon-print\"></span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"text-print\">Print</span>\n \t\t</a>\n\t</h2>\n\t\n\t<p>Modified on: Wed, 17 Sep, 2025 at 10:44 AM</p>\n\t<hr />\n\t\n\n\t<article class=\"article-body\" id=\"article-body\" rel=\"image-enlarge\">\n\t\t<p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">Charity - Users</strong></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><strong dir=\"ltr\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">Navigation</strong>: Capium Home &gt; 'C' icon &gt;&nbsp;</strong>Charity &gt; Manage&nbsp;</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><img data-id=\"9237219500\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9237219500/original/XFYHNsd1Zc6I96iYIWtRFxTpLavg0rtOGA.png?1758010178\"></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">Users will show up in <strong data-end=\"107\" data-start=\"89\">Manage &gt; Users</strong> after they have entered the <strong data-end=\"151\" data-start=\"134\" dir=\"ltr\">Charity</strong> module. To do so, they simply need to click the <strong data-end=\"212\" data-start=\"200\">‘C’ icon</strong> at the top and access the <strong data-end=\"254\" data-start=\"237\" dir=\"ltr\">Charity</strong> module at least once. Following that, they will be automatically included in the Users list.</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><img data-id=\"9237219620\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9237219620/original/KJh2zGyOU6kaYumk-l5DeKeWn-FTGdT0QA.png?1758010299\"></p><p><br></p>\n\t</article>\n\n\t<hr />\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t<p class=\"article-vote\" id=\"voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000271165\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?<span data-href=\"/support/solutions/articles/9000271165/thumbs_up\" class=\"vote-up a-link\" id=\"article_thumbs_up\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-remote=\"true\" data-method=\"put\" data-update=\"#voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000271165\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-update-with-message=\"Glad we could be helpful. Thanks for the feedback.\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes</span><span class=\"vote-down-container\"><span data-href=\"/support/solutions/articles/9000271165/thumbs_down\" class=\"vote-down a-link\" id=\"article_thumbs_down\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-remote=\"true\" data-method=\"put\" data-update=\"#vote-feedback-form\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000271165\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-hide-dom=\"#voting-container\" data-show-dom=\"#vote-feedback-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo</span></span></p><a class=\"hide a-link\" id=\"vote-feedback-form-link\" data-hide-dom=\"#vote-feedback-form-link\" data-show-dom=\"#vote-feedback-container\">Send feedback</a><div id=\"vote-feedback-container\"class=\"hide\">\t<div class=\"lead\">Sorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.</div>\t<div id=\"vote-feedback-form\">\t\t<div class=\"sloading loading-small loading-block\"></div>\t</div></div>\n\t\t\n"
